        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Recently, scientists in the U.S.A. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a huge "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fluffy",
            "ref": "v-fluffy"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " planet. It has the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "density",
            "zh": "密度"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "marshmallow",
            "zh": "棉花糖"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The planet is called TOI-3757 b. It is so huge that more than 1,300 Earths could "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " inside it. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " amazing thing about the planet is that it’s very light. If you could put it in a planet-sized "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bathtub",
            "zh": "浴缸"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", it would "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the surface of the water!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The planet "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "orbits",
            "ref": "v-orbit"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " very close to a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "red dwarf star",
            "zh": "红矮星"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Mercury",
            "zh": "水星"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " planet to the Sun in our "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "solar system",
            "ref": "v-solar-system"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " 88 days to orbit our star. The fluffy planet, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", orbits its star every three and a half days."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Since the two are so close to each other, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " isn’t TOI-3757 b getting burned by its star? Well, red dwarf stars are smaller, less bright and cooler than many other kinds of stars, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the Sun. So, like a marshmallow being "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "roasted",
            "ref": "v-roast"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " over a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "campfire",
            "ref": "v-campfire"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", this furry planet gets "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " warmed."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
